### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Success flow with order number
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/generate-reply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "msg-001",
  "subject": "Need order status for 4500012345",
  "sender": {
    "name": "Alex",
    "email": "alex@example.com"
  },
  "recipients": [],
  "bodyText": "Hi team, can you check order 4500012345 and send latest update?",
  "conversationId": "conv-001",
  "userAction": "generate_reply"
}

### Missing parameter flow
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/generate-reply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageId": "msg-002",
  "subject": "Can you check my order status?",
  "sender": {
    "name": "Jamie",
    "email": "jamie@example.com"
  },
  "recipients": [],
  "bodyText": "Please check my order.",
  "conversationId": "conv-002",
  "userAction": "generate_reply"
}

